`validate_gpx` (in `hikes/validators.py`) checks the content, not just the name:
- caps the size at 10 MB;
- parses with `defusedxml`, which blocks XML bombs and external entities (already installed, 0.7.1);
- requires the root to be `<gpx>` in the GPX 1.0 or 1.1 namespace;
- requires at least one track or route point.

It rewinds the file afterwards, so your view can still save it. Remember `enctype="multipart/form-data"` on the form; with htmx, add `hx-encoding="multipart/form-data"`. Trailmix tests are running.

